    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What a lovely surprise!</h2><br>A mysterious package arrives at your door, but don't worry, it's your new best friend Ainsley!<br>Build them, calibrate them, talk to them, teach them to be just like you and one day they just might talk back!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.poster.avif?t=1739354719\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.webm?t=1739354719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.mp4?t=1739354719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But is it all as it seems?</h2><br>Ainsley is part toy builder, part hacking puzzle, part questioning your sanity.<br><br>Encounter tricky puzzles in every step of building your new friend, wait... was that something out of the corner of your eye?<br><br>Collect information from the user manual, tutorial videos, objects around your room and messages with your friends to solve the puzzles. Someone or something seems to be working against you so you'll need all the help you can get!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What a lovely surprise!</h2><br>A mysterious package arrives at your door, but don't worry, it's your new best friend Ainsley!<br>Build them, calibrate them, talk to them, teach them to be just like you and one day they just might talk back!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.poster.avif?t=1739354719\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.webm?t=1739354719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835620/extras/3ddbd78c05cfbec96821af004fe87fd9.mp4?t=1739354719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But is it all as it seems?</h2><br>Ainsley is part toy builder, part hacking puzzle, part questioning your sanity.<br><br>Encounter tricky puzzles in every step of building your new friend, wait... was that something out of the corner of your eye?<br><br>Collect information from the user manual, tutorial videos, objects around your room and messages with your friends to solve the puzzles. Someone or something seems to be working against you so you'll need all the help you can get!",
